sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as End user (widget)
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant ID as identity
  participant CH as channel
  participant AG as agent-runtime
  participant AZ as authz
  participant RT as retrieval
  participant TG as tool-gateway
  participant MG as model-gateway
  participant CV as conversation

  U->>GW: message + widget token
  GW->>ID: validate token, resolve membership
  ID-->>GW: tenant-context token (tenant, actor, roles, groups)
  GW->>CH: forward with context token
  CH->>AG: run published agent version
  AG->>AZ: decide(actor, agent.query, agent)
  AZ-->>AG: allow
  alt knowledge intent
    AG->>RT: search(query)
    RT->>RT: tenant + ACL filter BEFORE ranking
    RT->>MG: embed / rerank
    RT-->>AG: authorized chunks only
  else account or action intent
    AG->>AZ: decide(actor, tool.invoke, tool)
    AG->>TG: invoke(tool, typed args)
    TG->>TG: schema check, secrets, egress allowlist
    TG-->>AG: minimized result
  end
  AG->>MG: generate grounded answer
  MG-->>AG: answer + citations
  AG->>AG: verify citations and evidence threshold
  alt sufficient evidence
    AG->>CV: persist with provenance + trace_id
    AG-->>CH: stream answer + citations
  else insufficient evidence
    AG-->>CH: clarify or escalate to human
  end
  CH-->>U: SSE stream
